ed by the auditor (mission never ran lbmpy): D2Q9 SRT collide_only kernel, omega=1/tau=1.25, same physical field (feq(rho=1,TGV u0=0.05)+1e-3 noise, Ma=0.086), channel mapping moment-verified (rho/u roundtrip 4.4e-16); lbmpy vs collide_bgk rel=0.2606%, lbmpy vs collide_bgk_fused rel=0.2606% -> PASS at 15% gate; residual attributed to equilibrium convention (lbmpy compressible 3rd-order terms)", "submission_state": "head_commit=null; git_status='M src/tensorlbm/solver.py / ?? xval/fused_kernel_type_selector/'; server_quality_audit={gate_valid:false,key_present:false,gate_missing_warning:true}", "level_rationale": "L1 only: unit-level numerical equivalence exists and is auditor-reproducible on main (<=5.3e-15). L2 not earned (no net functional code of its own; operators pre-exist on main, patch duplicates m17718 and is uncommitted). L3 not earned (no integration). L4 not earned (no benchmark case row, no run artifacts, no repro cmd, external anchor not executed by the mission). Report length does not change level."}$json$::jsonb, 'board-audit') ON CONFLICT (repo, scope, verdict_by) DO UPDATE SET mission_id=EXCLUDED.mission_id, level=EXCLUDED.level, evidence=EXCLUDED.evidence, gate_state='pending', gate_level=NULL, gate_note=NULL;
